in this movie.

00:07:02.354 --> 00:07:04.690
And I'm like -- That's
the secret move that he has.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:07.326
-Saving it for the sequel.
Spoiler alert!

00:07:07.326 --> 00:07:08.760
-It is so funny, though.

00:07:08.760 --> 00:07:11.497
If I can set the stage --
Let me do my job a little bit.

00:07:11.497 --> 00:07:13.499
So, basically,
what happens is...

00:07:13.499 --> 00:07:14.767
Lil Rel and his fiancée --

00:07:14.767 --> 00:07:16.502
