00:07:26.578 --> 00:07:30.049
And then he proposes to her.
They can't get another room.

00:07:30.049 --> 00:07:34.353
He proposes to her.
You -- You and your wife?

00:07:34.353 --> 00:07:36.488
-Yeah. Well, no, my partner.

00:07:36.488 --> 00:07:37.956
-Girlfriend.
You and your partner.

00:07:37.956 --> 00:07:39.558
-Yeah.
-Are out of control, by the way.

00:07:39.558 --> 00:07:41.894
Just two out-of-control idiots.

00:07:41.894 --> 00:07:43.963
-We just have a different
perspective on life.

00:07:43.963 --> 00:07:46.532
-Okay. I think it starts
with you riding a Jet Ski

00:07:46.532 --> 00:07:47.733
