00:07:47.733 --> 00:07:49.034
-Yeah.
-Anyways...

00:07:49.034 --> 00:07:51.103
That's how you meet
those people.

00:07:51.103 --> 00:07:53.338
Anyways, they go, "Hey..."
-One guy. "Yeah!"

00:07:53.338 --> 00:07:55.941
-I know. He's like, "I've done
that! I've done that!"

00:07:55.941 --> 00:07:57.009
-"Yeah!"
-Yeah.

00:07:57.009 --> 00:07:59.412
So then, you go,
"Hey, stay in our room.

00:07:59.412 --> 00:08:01.113
You guys are in love.
You're lovebirds.

00:08:01.113 --> 00:08:03.282
Stay in our -- We don't even
have to see each other."

00:08:03.282 --> 00:08:04.616
-Yeah.
-"Just stay in our..."

00:08:04.616 --> 00:08:06.152
And that's how
the movie kicks off,

00:08:06.152 --> 00:08:08.854
and then
just ridiculousness ensues.

00:08:08.854 --> 00:08:12.158
It is so funny.
Did I set it up correctly?

00:08:12.158 --> 00:08:13.659
-What's that?
-Did I set it up correctly?

00:08:13.659 --> 00:08:15.694
-[Bleep]. I hope they watch it.
You gave them the whole movie.

00:08:15.694 --> 00:08:18.931
-Yeah, I know. Well, yeah.
Did I go too much?

00:08:18.931 --> 00:08:21.367
Did I go too much? It's so good.
I want to show --

00:08:21.367 --> 00:08:24.002
Here's John Cena in
"Vacation Friends" on Hulu.

00:08:24.002 --> 00:08:26.171
Take a look.
-What's going on here?

00:08:26.171 --> 00:08:29.274
-Oh. Uh, we lost the brakes
around Marietta.

00:08:29.274 --> 00:08:31.543
E-brake did the yeoman's work
till right about now.

00:08:31.543 --> 00:08:34.046
Yo, chief! Just in case
